OL,3,GNEWSAFuel costs force tough choices for
OL,4,ASouth East firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses in the south east of England
OL,7,Fhave expressed fears that soaring fuel
OL,8,Fcosts are threatening the long-term
OL,9,Fviability of their operations.
OL,11,FAs conflict in the Middle East
OL,12,Fcontinues, diesel prices have reached a
OL,13,Frecord 199.33p a litre on Monday,
OL,14,Faccording to the RAC, with petrol
OL,15,Fprices at 174.23p.
OL,17,FDavid Zaccheo, general manager of
OL,18,FAlcaline UK Limited in Hythe, Kent,
OL,19,Ftold the BBC soaring diesel prices had
OL,20,Fbeen "detrimental" to his haulage
OL,21,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
